 lemma to identify energy.","citation_ids":["circuit-r2-26-cite-positive-mesh","eams2021_mean_field_optimization"],"evidence_ids":[],"id":"circuit.positive_mesh","kind":"claim","label":"Fixed-temperature normalized mesh converges strongly","locator":"07-positive-temperature.tex:452–532; lem:eams-positive-continuum, eq:euler-normalization-bound, eq:martingale-euler-bound, eq:value-riemann-bound","source_id":"circuit-r2-26-source-positive","statement":"At fixed finite β₀ and 0<T<q, the normalized Euler coupling has max_r E|X_r^δ−X_{t_r}|²≤Cδ, max_r|c_{δ,r}−1|≤C√δ, E|Z_δ−m(T,X_T)|²≤Cδ, and its corrected shifted energy sum differs from ∫₀ᵀE a by at most C√δ. Here L=floor(T/δ).","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/nodes/circuit.positive_mesh","relations":[{"derived":true,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/nodes/circuit.positive_mesh","id":"field:21da261b5238654a1ba4335fa3e21b698111c3f1f6c3e2fc9f24edb848773ded","kind":"assumption_ids","owner_ref":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/nodes/circuit.positive_mesh","semantic_class":"explicit_assumption_reference","source_field":"assumption_ids","to":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/nodes/circuit.positive_input"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/nodes/circuit.positive_mesh","id":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/edges/%5B%22circuit.positive_mesh%22%2C%22circuit.positive_finite_step%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","kind":"supports","record_ref":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/edges/%5B%22circuit.positive_mesh%22%2C%22circuit.positive_finite_step%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","semantic_class":"curated_argument_support","to":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc16